-start=\"1184\">Lean muscle growth</li>\n<li data-end=\"1232\" data-section-id=\"1qo5q5f\" data-start=\"1207\">Recovery optimisation</li>\n<li data-end=\"1259\" data-section-id=\"1n4fq96\" data-start=\"1233\">Growth hormone support</li>\n<li data-end=\"1282\" data-section-id=\"eh3dlj\" data-start=\"1260\">Body recomposition</li>\n<li data-end=\"1310\" data-section-id=\"1mf11wo\" data-start=\"1283\">Performance enhancement</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1440\" data-start=\"1312\">Some peptides are better for growth hormone support, while others are commonly used for recovery and muscle-building assistance.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1445\" data-start=\"1442\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"1510\" data-section-id=\"fc22bl\" data-start=\"1447\">CJC-1295 &amp; Ipamorelin – Best for Growth Hormone Support</h2>\n<p data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1512\">CJC-1295 and Ipamorelin are among the most popular peptide combinations for supporting growth hormone release, recovery, sleep quality, and muscle development.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"1695\" data-section-id=\"1elgzc\" data-start=\"1673\">Commonly used for:</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1795\" data-start=\"1696\">\n<li data-end=\"1719\" data-section-id=\"1bm1aqo\" data-start=\"1696\">Lean muscle support</li>\n<li data-end=\"1745\" data-section-id=\"1qo5q5f\" data-start=\"1720\">Recovery optimisation</li>\n<li data-end=\"1763\" data-section-id=\"1lqly94\" data-start=\"1746\">Sleep support</li>\n<li data-end=\"1795\" data-section-id=\"1bset71\" data-start=\"1764\">Growth hormone optimisation</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1874\" data-start=\"1797\"><a href=\"https://peptidesbali.online/cjc-1295-bali/\">👉 Learn more about CJC-1295 in Bali</a><br data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1833\"/><a href=\"https://peptidesbali.online/ipamorelin-bali/\">👉 Learn more about Ipamorelin in Bali</a></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1879\" data-start=\"1876\"/>\n<h2 data-end=\"1931\" data-section-id=\"r896ml\" data-start=\"1881\">IGF-1 LR3 – Best for Muscle Growth Support</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2042\" d